      "title": "Tomorrow (17th), we will understand the proof of Thoerem 20.16 (Complete g-actions are inf",
      "text": "Tomorrow (17th), we will understand the proof of Thoerem 20.16 (Complete g-actions are infinitesimal generators of G-actions, when G is simply connected). This proof will not be included in the final exam. You can also go over your graded midsem papers tomorrow. Before class, please see the midsem solutions that have been uploaded.\n\nThursday's class will be a tutorial session. Please send me any questions you may have from HW5-11 by Wednesday morning 10am. If you would like me to revise any topic, please let me know as well.",
